WEBVTT

00:07:28.042 --> 00:07:30.351
is a warm-blooded mammal.

00:07:30.375 --> 00:07:35.143
But the dead are so cold
they could be carved from marble.

00:07:35.167 --> 00:07:36.768
Later in life,

00:07:36.792 --> 00:07:39.643
when I took my own dead brother Bernard

00:07:39.667 --> 00:07:41.809
in my arms,

00:07:41.833 --> 00:07:44.559
and kissed and embraced him,

00:07:44.583 --> 00:07:47.184
I could not at first believe

00:07:47.208 --> 00:07:51.958
that this stone-cold mannequin
had ever been human.

00:07:53.292 --> 00:07:55.917
And here's another existential epiphany.

00:07:57.125 --> 00:08:00.726
As you are sitting here listening to me,